Description:It is your first main phase. You control Gnarlwood Dryad (delirium: +2/+2), Ornithopter, Grizzly Bears and Ashnod's Altar; your graveyard holds Shock and a Forest. The opponent is at 3 life; Ornithopter and Grizzly Bears came under your control this turn. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn and keep Grizzly Bears.
Rule:authored-delirium-two-types | Delirium counts card types among cards in your graveyard (CR 205.2a), and an artifact creature card has two: sacrificing Ornithopter to Ashnod's Altar adds artifact and creature to instant and land, four types, so Gnarlwood Dryad attacks as a 3/3; sacrificing Grizzly Bears adds only creature
